    "Items go to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los ítems van a la Papelera."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Items in the Trash category, and everything when permanent delete is on in Settings, are deleted and can’t be put back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los ítems de la categoría Papelera, y todo cuando el borrado permanente está activo en Ajustes, se borran y no se pueden recuperar."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Items won’t go to the Trash, so you can’t put them back. KeelMac still shows a preview and asks before every cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los ítems no irán a la Papelera, así que no podrás recuperarlos. KeelMac sigue mostrando una vista previa y pregunta antes de cada limpieza."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "JSON": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
