    "The helper runs only the tasks listed in Maintenance and Login items, checks every path again before touching it, and accepts requests only from KeelMac signed by the same developer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente solo ejecuta las tareas que aparecen en Mantenimiento e Ítems de inicio, revisa cada ruta otra vez antes de tocarla y solo acepta solicitudes de KeelMac firmado por el mismo desarrollador."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The item is stopped and its plist moves to the Trash. The app it belongs to may add it again when it next runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El ítem se detiene y su plist va a la Papelera. La app a la que pertenece podría volver a añadirlo la próxima vez que se ejecute."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The load line is 85% full. Keep below it so macOS has room for updates and swap.": {
      "localizations": {
